ce–time gradient = speed. Rise over run."}]},{"caption":"Velocity–time graphs: slope is acceleration, area is distance","duration_ms":11000,"id":"s3","narration":"Now the vertical axis is velocity: the line rises from 0 to 20 metres per second in 10 seconds, so its slope is 20 over 10 — an acceleration of 2 metres per second squared. Watch the shaded area grow under the line as time passes: that area is the distance travelled — 100 metres.","steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"title","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"Reading a velocity–time graph","x":80,"y":70}},{"at_ms":400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"xAxis","kind":"line","stroke":"#2c3e50","width":3,"x1":120,"x2":760,"y1":420,"y2":420}},{"at_ms":700,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"yAxis","kind":"line","stroke":"#2c3e50","width":3,"x1":120,"x2":120,"y1":420,"y2":100}},{"at_ms":1000,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"xL","kind":"text","size":22,"text":"time: 0 → 10 s","x":560,"y":460}},{"at_ms":1200,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"yL","kind":"text","size":22,"text":"velocity: 0 → 20 m/s","x":140,"y":110}},{"at_ms":1600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"gline","kind":"line","stroke":"#7d3c98","width":5,"x1":120,"x2":720,"y1":420,"y2":120}},{"at_ms":2600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"slope","kind":"latex","color":"#1f7a3a","size":34,"tex":"a = \\frac{20\\ \\text{m/s}}{10\\ \\text{s}} = 2\\ \\text{m/s}^2","x":80,"y":505}},{"at_ms":3400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"sweep","kind":"circle","cx":140,"cy":413,"r":10,"fill":"#e67e22","stroke":"#a05a10","width":2}},{"at_ms":3600,"do":"move","dur_ms":1800,"target":"sweep","to":{"cx":420,"cy":270}},{"at_ms":3800,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"r1","kind":"rect","x":150,"y":360,"w":90,"h":0,"fill":"#d6eaf8","stroke":"#2471a3","width":2}},{"at_ms":4000,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"r1","to":{"h":60}},{"at_ms":5000,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"r2","kind":"rect","x":250,"y":310,"w":90,"h":0,"fill":"#d6eaf8","stroke":"#2471a3","width":2}},{"at_ms":5200,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"r2","to":{"h":110}},{"at_ms":5400,"do":"move","dur_ms":1800,"target":"sweep","to":{"cx":700,"cy":130}},{"at_ms":6200,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"r3","kind":"rect","x":350,"y":260,"w":90,"h":0,"fill":"#d6eaf8","stroke":"#2471a3","width":2}},{"at_ms":6400,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"r3","to":{"h":160}},{"at_ms":7400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"r4","kind":"rect","x":450,"y":210,"w":90,"h":0,"fill":"#d6eaf8","stroke":"#2471a3","width":2}},{"at_ms":7600,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"r4","to":{"h":210}},{"at_ms":8600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"r5","kind":"rect","x":550,"y":160,"w":90,"h":0,"fill":"#d6eaf8","stroke":"#2471a3","width":2}},{"at_ms":8800,"do":"move","dur_ms":600,"target":"r5","to":{"h":260}},{"at_ms":9600,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"dist","kind":"latex","color":"#1f7a3a","size":32,"tex":"d = \\text{area} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 10 \\times 20 = 100\\ \\text{m}","x":560,"y":505}},{"at_ms":10200,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"note","kind":"text","size":22,"text":"Triangle, not rectangle —","x":640,"y":60}},{"at_ms":10200,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"note2","kind":"text","size":22,"text":"velocity is changing.","x":640,"y":94}},{"at_ms":10600,"do":"caption","text":"Slope = acceleration. Area under the line = distance."}]},{"caption":"Check the thinking","duration_ms":9000,"id":"s4","narration":"Here is the classic trap: a runner jogs 400 metres down a track, turns, and jogs back in 100 seconds total. Distance is 800 metres, so speed is 8 metres per second — but displacement is zero, so velocity is zero.","steps":[{"at_ms":0,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"title","kind":"text","size":34,"text":"Check the thinking","x":80,"y":70}},{"at_ms":400,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"myth","kind":"text","size":28,"text":"❌ “Speed and velocity are the same thing.”","x":80,"y":170}},{"at_ms":1200,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"track","kind":"line","stroke":"#5d6d7e","width":4,"x1":120,"x2":840,"y1":300,"y2":300}},{"at_ms":1500,"do":"show","shape":{"id":"out","kind":"arrow","stroke":"#c0392b","width":5,"x1"